{"forumTopic": {"authorId": 32278387, "authorThumbnailName": "default-thumb.png", "authorUserDisplayName": "Yield Smarter", "authorUserName": "yieldsmarter", "comments": [{"id": 3468183, "postDate": "2026-06-08T15:59:25.080Z", "rawMarkdown": "> Doesn't this mean the best case would be beating each human baseline resulting in 1.15?\n\nYes, per level you can score up to 1.15x. This gets capped at 100% per game. You can't score >100% on a game\n\nWe talk more about it in our scoring section here\nhttps://arcprize.org/blog/arc-agi-3-human-dataset", "content": "<blockquote>\n  <p>Doesn't this mean the best case would be beating each human baseline resulting in 1.15?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Yes, per level you can score up to 1.15x. This gets capped at 100% per game. You can't score &gt;100% on a game</p>\n<p>We talk more about it in our scoring section here\n<a href=\"https://arcprize.org/blog/arc-agi-3-human-dataset\" target=\"_blank\">https://arcprize.org/blog/arc-agi-3-human-dataset</a></p>", "replies": [{"id": 3468271, "postDate": "2026-06-08T18:29:05.983Z", "rawMarkdown": "How come then the top team have a score of 1.30 (=130%) if the scores are capped at 1.0 (100%)?", "content": "<p>How come then the top team have a score of 1.30 (=130%) if the scores are capped at 1.0 (100%)?</p>", "replies": [{"id": 3468288, "postDate": "2026-06-08T18:57:16.263Z", "rawMarkdown": "We have 1.30%.", "content": "<p>We have 1.30%.</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Jeroen Cottaar", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/14984949-kg.jpg?t=2024-09-29-14-54-24", "url": "/jeroencottaar", "tier": "GRANDMASTER", "id": 14984949, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"totalVotes": 1, "canUpvote": true, "totalUpvotes": 1}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 1, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "Dries Smit", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kag